    "name": "nx_sim_flow_convergence",
    "title": null,
    "description": "Set convergence controls on an active NX MULTIPHYSICS Flow SIM by document ID. Requires attached Flow Solution Parameters and verified RMS mode 1. residual and flow_imbalance_fraction are finite dimensionless fractions strictly between 0 and 1 (0.001 means 0.1%); iteration_limit is an integer 1..100000 for steady flow. Enables the flow-imbalance criterion and returns before/actual values. Does not save, launch or cancel a solve. Use only when no solver job is running. Changes require prior results to be revalidated. Repeating identical settings is a no-op; failed mutations attempt verified rollback. These requested controls are not evidence of achieved convergence. Supply operation_id for safe retry.",
